        <object id="N_LOC_PITTOP" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_PITTOP — at top of small pit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;At your feet is a small pit breathing traces of white mist.  An east&lt;br&gt;passage ends here except for a small crack leading on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. DEPRE → LOC_GRATE [Ch 01] [not GRATE=GRATE_CLOSED]&lt;br&gt;2. ENTRA → LOC_BELOWGRATE&lt;br&gt;3. DEBRI → LOC_DEBRIS&lt;br&gt;4. PASSA, EAST → LOC_BIRDCHAMBER&lt;br&gt;5. DOWN, PIT, STEPS → LOC_NECKBROKE [Ch 11] [carry NUGGET]&lt;br&gt;6. DOWN → LOC_MISTHALL&lt;br&gt;7. CRACK, WEST → LOC_CRACK" source_id="LOC_PITTOP" description_en="At your feet is a small pit breathing traces of white mist.  An east&#10;passage ends here except for a small crack leading on." description_es="" short_en="You're at top of small pit." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ENTRY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_PITTOP" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_GRATE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_GRATE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;object&quot;: &quot;GRATE&quot;, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;GRATE_CLOSED&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;not&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DEPRE&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BELOWGRATE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BELOWGRATE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;ENTRA&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_DEBRIS&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_DEBRIS&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DEBRI&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BIRDCHAMBER&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BIRDCHAMBER&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quo